Description:
 edulution-fileproxy - WebDAV server with SMB backend and NTLM authentication
Changes:
 edulution-fileproxy (1.5.0) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Release of 1.5.0~rc2, which was tested on an existing installation, with
     one fix found there: the logrotate config named only webdav-server.log,
     so a log.file such as server.log was never rotated. It now rotates every
     *.log in /var/log/edulution-fileproxy, and postinst names any other
     logrotate file that also rotates there, since logrotate refuses a log
     that two files name.
   * README.Debian and the runbook say how to keep an Elasticsearch outside the
     sidecar current: on 8.x, at least at the pinned version, and restarted
     after its own upgrade.
   * The entry for 1.5.0~rc2 below lists everything else that changed since
     1.4.1.
